    "title": "Red Ginger closing; operations, staff moving to reopened Izumi Steakhouse - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KWQC Staff ,\n4 hours ago DAVENPORT, Iowa (KWQC) - Bettendorf’s Red Ginger has closed, according to a post on the Izumi Steakhouse Facebook page Wednesday. The post announced that Izumi, which had been temporarily closed, reopened its doors on Wednesday and that they are ‘merging business’ with Red Ginger, moving the Red Ginger staff and menu items to the Izumi Steakhouse in Davenport. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
